{
  "case_id": "REN-SHIELD-BOUNDARY-1.20.1",
  "title": "游戏大师立牌(ren)鼠鼠护盾(1.20.1 Forge):5 分钟窗口的边界与回拨口径(3 分钟不足 / 5 分钟恰好 / 未佩戴不补)",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "bugfix",
    "ref": "ren-shield-boundary"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的(与 1.21.1 侧对等):把「被动间隔 = 5 分钟(6000 tick)」这个**常量**证伪/证实 —— 主用例 `REN-SHIELD-1.20.1` 只证明「真实等待 5 分钟会补盾」,任何 ≤6000 的实现都能过;本用例用回拨法补上**下界**。\n口径:①`renprep B1` 装备并复位;②`renread B1` 断言 `:now=` **≥ 6000**(回拨法的前提,不满足即 FAIL);③`rentimer B2 3000` ⇒ 2.5 s 内不得补盾;④`rentimer B3 6000` ⇒ 补盾且齐全(absorb=10 / counter=1 / res=1 / counterfx=1);⑤`renunequip B4N` + `rentimer B4N 6000` ⇒ 未佩戴不补盾;⑥`renvoid B5` 收尾。\n平台差异:探针取效果走 `.get()`(1.20.1 的 ModEffects 是 RegistryObject)。\n⚠️ 必须在世界时钟 > 6000 的世界里跑(紧随 `REN-SHIELD-1.20.1` 之后同会话运行即可);探针改动需**冷启动**。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renprep B1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B1",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe rentimer B2 3000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe rentimer B3 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B3",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renunequip B4N",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe rentimer B4N 6000",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renread B4N",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe renvoid B5",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B1_STATE:shield=0:absorb=0:counter=0:res=0:base=0:last=[0-9]+:now=([6-9][0-9]{3}|[0-9]{5,})"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_TIMER:armed=1:rewound=3000"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B2_STATE:shield=0:absorb=0:counter=0:res=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_TIMER:armed=1:rewound=6000"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B3_STATE:shield=1:absorb=10:counter=1:res=1:base=0.*counterfx=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B4N_TIMER:armed=0:rewound=6000"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B4N_STATE:shield=0:absorb=0:counter=0:res=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_B[0-9N]+_ERR|AP_B[0-9N]+_EX"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ],
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running"
}
